Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Message Boards|

Set Up: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG

Tear Down: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|

Scenario: Add MB Category
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|portal.acceptance|true|
	When Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Message Boards|
	And MessageboardsCategory add CP
		|categoryName|MB Category Name|
	Then MessageboardsCategory view CP
		|categoryName|MB Category Name|
		|subcategoriesNumber|0|
		|threadsNumber|0|

Scenario: Add MB Category Subcategory
Priority: 4
	Given Navigator open URL
	When ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Message Boards|
	And MessageboardsCategory add CP
		|categoryName|MB Category Name|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Message Boards|
	Then MessageboardsCategory add Subcategory CP
		|categoryName|MB Category Name|
		|subCategoryDescription|MB Subcategory Description|
		|subCategoryName|MB Subcategory Name|

Scenario: Add MB Thread
Priority: 5
	Given Navigator open URL
	When ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Message Boards|
	And MessageboardsThread add CP
		|threadBody|MB Thread Message Body|
		|threadSubject|MB Thread Message Subject|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Message Boards|
	Then MessageboardsThread view CP
		|postsNumber|1|
		|threadBody|MB Thread Message Body|
		|threadSubject|MB Thread Message Subject|

Scenario: CK Editor Smoke
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|custom.properties|editor.wysiwyg.portal-web.docroot.html.portlet.message_boards.edit_message.bb_code.jsp=ckeditor${line.separator}editor.wysiwyg.portal-web.docroot.html.portlet.message_boards.edit_message.html.jsp=ckeditor|
	When Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Message Boards|
	And Click at locator 'Button#PLUS'
	And AssertClick the value 'Thread' at locator 'MenuItem#THREAD'
	And Type the value 'CKEditor Entry Subject' at locator 'TextInput#SUBJECT'
	And CKEditor assert Editor Present
	And CKEditor add Content
		|content|CKEditor Entry Body|
	And PortletEntry publish
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Message Boards|
	Then MessageboardsThread view CP
		|postsNumber|1|
		|threadBody|CKEditor Entry Body|
		|threadSubject|CKEditor Entry Subject|

Scenario: Delete MB Categories
Priority: 4
	Given Navigator open URL
	When ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Message Boards|
	And MessageboardsCategory add CP
		|categoryName|MB Category1 Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Message Boards|
	And MessageboardsCategory add CP
		|categoryName|MB Category2 Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Message Boards|
	And MessageboardsCategory add CP
		|categoryName|MB Category3 Name|
	And MessageboardsCategory tear Down CP
		|assetType|3 items|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Message Boards|
	Then AssertTextEquals assert Text the value 'There are no threads nor categories.' at locator 'Message#EMPTY_INFO'

Scenario: Delete MB Thread With Attachment
Priority: 3
	Given these properties
		|custom.properties|trash.entry.check.interval=1${line.separator}trash.entries.max.age=1|
	When ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Site add Blank CP
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Message Boards|
	And MessageboardsThread add CP With Attachment
		|mbAttachmentFile|Document_1.doc|
		|threadBody|MB Body|
		|threadSubject|MB Subject|
	And ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Message Boards|
	And MessageboardsThread move To Recycle Bin CP
		|threadSubject|MB Subject|
	And Pause at locator '120000'
	And AssertConsoleTextNotPresent the value 'MessageListenerException'
	And AssertConsoleTextNotPresent the value 'com.liferay.portlet.documentlibrary.NoSuchFileEntryException'
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Recycle Bin|
	Then AssertTextEquals the value 'The Recycle Bin is empty.' at locator 'Message#EMPTY_INFO'

