Scenario: View Anonymous Posting Allowed Checkbox Configuration
Priority: 3
	Given Navigator open URL
	When ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Message Boards|
	And MessageboardsThread view Anonymous Posting Checkbox CP
	And MessageboardsPortlet configure Anonymous Posting CP
		|anonymousPostingEnabled|false|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Message Boards|
	And Portlet goto Portlet Options
		|portletOption|Configuration|
	And MessageboardsPortlet view Anonymous Posting Configuration CP
		|anonymousPostingEnabled|false|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Message Boards|
	Then MessageboardsThread view No Anonymous Posting Checkbox CP

Scenario: View BB Code No XSS
Priority: 4
	Given Navigator open URL
	When ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Message Boards|
	And MessageboardsPortlet configure General CP
		|messageFormat|BBCode|
		|messageFormatBBCodeEnabled|true|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Message Boards|
	And MessageboardsThread add CP
		|source|true|
		|threadBody|[img]Not An Image[font= onerror=alert(/XSS/.source)//]FF[/font][/img]|
		|threadSubject|New Thread Subject|
	And MessageboardsThread assert Alert Not Present
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Message Boards|
	And MessageboardsThread view CP
		|postsNumber|1|
		|threadBody||
		|threadSubject|New Thread Subject|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Message Boards|
	And MessageboardsThread add CP
		|fontSize|24|
		|source|true|
		|threadBody|[size=5]Thread Body[/size]|
		|threadSubject|New Thread Subject 2|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Message Boards|
	Then MessageboardsThread view CP
		|fontSize|24|
		|postsNumber|1|
		|threadBody|Thread Body|
		|threadSubject|New Thread Subject 2|